Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nanatsuiro Drops 2
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Translated By: Oneil
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Edited by Aiko, Saintwolf, and HavocAngel
Comment: 0,0:11:30.85,0:11:32.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,That tickles...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:07.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What is this, a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:12.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That's right, a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:14.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Of course it's a dream. {HA: Yume(Dream) ni(At, by, for, from, in, on, to) Kimateru (Kimaru = To Decide, Kimeru = Decide Teru = Shine) kimateru(mean to say that if somebody made like this from the begining it supposed to be like this till the end no matter what)!In simple words-kind of idiotizm,stupidity and things like that.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.48,0:00:21.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}{\fade(0,1000)}A bad dream, just a bad dream! {nightmare}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.43,0:02:11.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}{HA: Yume teru no}{HA: Thinking this is part of the next line... The worst part about dreaming... is the moment you wake up.}The worst part about dreaming is the moment you wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.95,0:02:13.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's supposed to be that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.26,0:02:17.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Open your eyes, don't do anything and settle down. {Saintwolf:Open your eyes, do nothing and settle down.} {HA: I like the first one better}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.31,0:02:22.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Nothing will change. It's just a normal room. {Saintwolf: It's just a normal room.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.01,0:02:53.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down, this is just a dream! {Saintwolf: Calm down, this is just a dream!}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:55.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.03,0:02:55.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:07.91,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What am I doing? {Saintwolf: What am I doing?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:19.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,A normal morning. {Saintwolf: A normal morning}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:22.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing different from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:29.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Was the sheep doll, the star drops and everything just a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.14,0:03:29.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],Keisuke,0000,0000,0000,,Yo, Haru.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.40,0:03:31.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nobuko,0000,0000,0000,,Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:36.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Then why was I sleeping in Akihime's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.83,0:03:40.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nobuko,0000,0000,0000,,You never change, Tsuwabuki. {Aiko: I think she is saying something about looking pitiful - Oneil: she is saying tsuwabuki is just like always (not sociable) } {Saintwolf: You never change, Tsuwabuki}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.73,0:03:44.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],Keisuke,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Haru. I heard you joined the Gardening Club. Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:46.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:49.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],Keisuke,0000,0000,0000,,I never knew you liked gardening... {Saintwolf: I never knew you liked gardening (Sounds better in my opinion} {HA: You never said you liked gardening... (he doesnt remember him telling him)}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.99,0:03:51.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:52.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],Girl A,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Nako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:53.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],Girl B,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Sumomo-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:56.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:09.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:14.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wonder why Akihime is different at school. {Saintwolf: I wonder why Akihime is different at school}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.34,0:04:24.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Well it's fine since I returned to my old self. {HA: Well, it's fine since I returned to my old self.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.63,0:04:33.95,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Uwahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.05,0:04:41.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,G-Guess it's going to be like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.81,0:04:44.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Yep, that's how it's going to be indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.42,0:04:52.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,In the morning as the sun comes up, you go back to your human body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.14,0:04:54.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,When the day is over, you will be back to your doll body.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.03,0:04:57.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,It's an easy rule to understand. {HA: It's an easy rule to understand.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:04:59.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,So it's like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.11,0:05:06.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,That, and the transformation effect in Figurare has a connection with the moon phase. {Saintwolf: Has a connection} {HA: That, and the transformation effect in Figurare is connected with the moon phase.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:08.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,The moon phase?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.77,0:05:12.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,For example during the new moon, you will not transform. {also known as crescent moon}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.30,0:05:14.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,You will stay your human form for the whole day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:18.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,But watch out, during the opposite phase, full moon, you will stay as a doll the whole day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.59,0:05:19.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:23.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Like I said, it's the moon effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.55,0:05:28.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, Tsuwabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:30.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight you will go to the Stellar Spinear's side again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:34.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, one more thing...{Thats's right, another thing.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.96,0:05:38.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let anyone see you taking the star drops, okay?! {Saintwolf: Don't let anyone see you taking the star drops, okay!} {HA: okay?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:43.47,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,Otherwise, it will become really complicated. {Saintwolf: Otherwise, it will become really complicated}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:52.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,I'm flying...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.69,0:05:55.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.19,0:06:03.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Err...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.10,0:06:07.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Uwahh, it's so cute! {HA: Uwahh, so cute! || Uwahh, very cute!}{I'd go with the "so cute" one. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:12.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sfather,0000,0000,0000,,It just came in today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.79,0:06:17.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],Smom,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This is a uniform I made a long time ago. {HA: This is a uniform that I made a long time ago.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.90,0:06:20.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],Smom,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Now Sumomo, I think it will fit you perfectly. {Now Sumomo, I think it will fit you perfectly. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.70,0:06:22.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],Smom,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It will look nice on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.58,0:06:23.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],Smom,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}From... Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:30.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sfather,0000,0000,0000,,Even though she's overseas, Mom always thinks of you everyday, Sumomo. {Saintwolf: Even though she is overseas, mom is thinking about you everyday, Sumomo.} {HA: Mom, every day}{Even though she's in overseas, Mom always thinks of you everyday, Sumomo. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:34.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:38.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sfather,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'll go finish writing my manuscript. {Saintwolf: Well then, I'll go finish writing my manuscript.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.07,0:06:41.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sfather,0000,0000,0000,,Deadlines, deadlines...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.36,0:06:42.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.23,0:06:46.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,So Akihime's father is a novel writer? {HA: So Akihimi's father is a novel writer?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:49.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,And her mother is overseas. {HA: overseas.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.09,0:07:14.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.86,0:07:20.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Where did you go? You were gone this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:24.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I thought Yuki-chan and the star drops were just a dream. {Saintwolf: just a dream} {HA: omit all with saint's ^}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.76,0:07:26.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,I can't breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.70,0:07:32.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,It seems that I can only come here during the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:34.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:40.16,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Also, we shouldn't let anyone see us when we're using magic. {anyone see us when we're using magic. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.16,0:07:42.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:45.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.27,0:07:47.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,You look so cute, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.61,0:07:54.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Looking good! All of them look lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.30,0:08:00.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,As I thought, compared to her at school, she looks more lively at home. {here}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.26,0:08:04.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yep, let's use this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.61,0:08:07.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Am I a cow now? {Ugh... this line is... I wish we could change this into a simple "What are you doing?" line... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:10.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:12.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,It's the star drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.88,0:08:21.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:26.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,The ring isn't{HA: isn't} responding anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.89,0:08:30.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,It's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.94,0:08:48.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I can't reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:51.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,A little bit more. Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:09:00.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,The star drops have an affinity to water, so... {HA: to water, so (also, so could go on the next line to make it look better)}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.49,0:09:02.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,it must be chasing the rain. {check} {HA: This line is redundant with the last line, it has an attraction, so it must be attracted?}{fixed}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.68,0:09:13.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Aki- Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.59,0:09:15.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.18,0:09:18.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,You're using my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:23.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay? You look really wet too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.07,0:09:34.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Are you alright, Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.27,0:09:35.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,N-Nako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:38.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.05,0:09:40.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.59,0:09:45.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.27,0:09:52.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, use the chant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:56.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H985443&}Puruvu Radi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:04.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I-I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.77,0:10:11.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I got it! Yuki-chan, I got it, the star drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:18.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Oh noooo! {OMG!}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:19.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Someone saw us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:25.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, why don't you come by my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:28.49,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,You'll catch a cold with those wet clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:32.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.23,0:11:06.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Yaeno...{Aiko: TL check this line please}{Oneil: no problem from what I see}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Shall I clean your butt too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.66,0:11:41.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,No thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.26,0:11:46.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,That was you speaking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.87,0:11:50.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.90,0:11:54.99,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,I see, so you can speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.80,0:11:58.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,I saw you moving and jumping around too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:01.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}S-She saw everything!{She saw them all!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.29,0:12:05.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan, that was a good bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.38,0:12:08.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Do you feel better now? {Do you feel hot now?} {HA: hot?.... Are you warmer now?}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:09.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:15.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Did you clean those?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.42,0:12:21.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,What is this thing called?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.95,0:12:25.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, she found out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:31.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Err, umm... I'm sorry, it's not that I wanted to hide Yuki-chan from you. {Saintwolf: it's not that I wanted to hide Yuki-chan from you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.07,0:12:32.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,So it's called Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:36.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,It's already late now so shall we head out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.87,0:12:39.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Mom said she will drive you back home.{check}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:48.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Found it. Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:55.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,When a person from Retroscena sees a Spinear gathering star drops,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.80,0:12:58.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,that person's memory must be deleted. {removed}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.32,0:13:01.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,By using the Ladle {the big spoon}{HA: LADLE (THERE IS NO SPOON) lol}to hit the person's head,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:09.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,the memory can be erased using the power from Figurare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.18,0:13:12.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Delete the memory...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.84,0:13:15.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like we are okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.21,0:13:22.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it; such a thing as deleting Nako-chan's memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.57,0:13:28.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,But you will only delete the memory about the incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.29,0:13:29.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:34.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like Nako-chan is going to forget about you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.39,0:13:43.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,But the memory of Nako-chan cleaning these clothes will disappear... {Saintwolf: Cleaning these clothes}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.18,0:13:50.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan cleaned it carefully from top to bottom. {check}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.87,0:13:55.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Deleting such a kind feeling from her...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:58.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.65,0:14:13.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,We've always been together...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.41,0:14:15.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Since we were little. {Saintwolf: Since we were small}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:19.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan was always there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.45,0:14:23.52,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Always taking care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.87,0:15:02.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:08.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.83,0:15:10.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:12.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.63,0:15:33.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,With the Gardening Club privilege, I'm going to take a Hydrangea flower.{Aiko: A WHAT?} {Saintwolf: Definition of Hydrangea - any of various deciduous or evergreen shrubs of the genus Hydrangea } {HA: It's flower talk, you wouldnt understand xD}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.29,0:15:36.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.84,0:15:41.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.89,0:15:42.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:50.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Things seem awkward between them.{They aren't doing so well.}{They are pretty awkward} {check}{Aiko: Maybe use awkward or acting strange}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:53.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Must be because of what happened yesterday. {HA: Must be because of what happened yesterday.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.51,0:16:00.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I have a favor to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.29,0:16:05.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Can you walk Sumomo home today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.01,0:16:05.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:07.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Me with Akihime?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.21,0:16:10.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,How about you, Nako-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:15.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,I have to stop by somewhere to take care of something for my mother{run an errand}. {HA: I have to stop by my mother's work ? Or is she eluding the fact for some reason} {I have to stop by where my mother works. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.56,0:16:20.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Don't push yourself like yesterday, okay? {Don't push yourself like yesterday, okay?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.28,0:16:22.08,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Or you'll catch a cold. {HA: catch cold}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.62,0:16:25.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nako,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.44,0:16:26.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.15,0:17:05.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,It's raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:14.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.13,0:17:45.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.55,0:17:47.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:49.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Just talk normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.25,0:17:54.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Just a normal answer is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:56.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.02,0:18:03.02,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Are you alright? {Saintwolf: Are you alright?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:07.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Since you are different than usual, Akihime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.44,0:18:12.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.89,0:18:21.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have a special friend, Tsuwabuki-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.26,0:18:28.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Someone that you've been with since you were young. {Saintwolf: Since you were small?} {HA: Since when you were young?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.65,0:18:30.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,And you talk about everything with her. {Saintwolf: Talk about everything}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.98,0:18:34.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Keeping no secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:36.78,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,A really important friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:41.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.59,0:18:43.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Continue on with the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.99,0:18:50.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,With such{HA: an} an important friend like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.85,0:18:56.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,you shouldn't lie or something like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.74,0:19:11.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,You can, maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:12.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:16.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Because lies come in different types. {HA: Because these/this are/is a differant kind of lies/lie} {Because lies come in different types. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.05,0:19:21.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,You treasure your friend very much, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.52,0:19:25.84,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Then I think everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.28,0:19:34.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I can't say it any better. {Saintwolf: Sorry, I can't say it any better.}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:42.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Escorting you this far is fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.53,0:19:45.18,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,I have to get back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.18,0:19:46.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.32,0:19:50.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sumomo,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:58.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,This is strange, I'm not transforming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:02.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,The sun should have gone down already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.76,0:20:03.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.32,0:20:07.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,During the new moon, you will not transform. {also known as crescent moon}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.67,0:20:10.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],Kisaragi,0000,0000,0000,,You will stay your human form the whole day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.16,0:20:12.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,New moon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.67,0:20:22.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi-sensei! {Saintwolf: Kisaragi-sensei!}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.61,0:20:30.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, he is not here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.85,0:20:34.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Is there any other way without erasing Yaeno's memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.97,0:20:37.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thinking Sensei{HA: Sensei} might have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.83,0:20:42.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it! What can I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.36,0:21:07.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.39,0:21:19.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],Sfather,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan, you got a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.20,0:21:24.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, tonight I cannot go to Sumomo's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:27.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,But I found this in the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.35,0:21:30.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,A way so that we don't have to erase Nako-chan's memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.40,0:21:37.24,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,If you two truly believe in each other then telling the secret is permitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:39.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,To only one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.06,0:21:45.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, chant this while holding Nako-chan's hand. {whatever they doing, holding hand?} {HA: Listen, hold her hands and chant this, Nako-chan. - Oneil: this will be completely different meaning}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.61,0:21:47.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs28\fnCalligraph421 BT\3c&H985443&}Ruaro {check}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.41,0:21:54.01,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,If Sumomo-chan and Nako-chan truly believe in each other then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.28,0:21:56.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yukichan,0000,0000,0000,,...a mark will appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:23.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}On the next day I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.11,0:22:27.74,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The mark of a believer. {is there another word? :P Since it supposed to be 2 person believe in each other}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.07,0:22:38.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],Tsuwabuki,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I wonder why I feel so surprisingly relieved. {Aqua: I wonder why I feel so surprisingly relieved}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.15,0:24:21.58,Nanatsuiro[Default],Yayoi,0000,0000,0000,,During Tanabata...  {http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tanabata}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.58,0:24:23.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nobuko,0000,0000,0000,,Why does it rain every year? {Saintwolf: Why does it rain every year?}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.30,0:24:25.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nobuko,0000,0000,0000,,Even when it's a day for lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.54,0:24:26.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],Keisuke,0000,0000,0000,,That's why it rains.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.35,0:24:26.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],Nobuko,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.90,0:24:29.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],Unknown,0000,0000,0000,,Speaking of which, on Tanabata a transfer student came.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.14,0:24:30.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],Unknown,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of person?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.03,0:24:30.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],Keisuke,0000,0000,0000,,Beautiful girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.51,0:24:31.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],Unknown,0000,0000,0000,,Beautiful girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.28,0:24:32.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],Keisuke,0000,0000,0000,,Love at first sight with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.18,0:24:33.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],Unknown,0000,0000,0000,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.66,0:24:34.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],Unknown,0000,0000,0000,,won't happen.
